 prices for each different customer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You're still a student, let me give you a 50% discount? &quot;&quot; Sorry, this baby just gave away for free. &quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udd2a  The small knife can be used, but the dragon slaying knife can be retracted, retracted, retracted!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Team Management\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit various employees to expand the size of your store, including security, welcome, and a cute dog?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the store is understaffed, recruit employees (remember to respect your employees!) to form your champion team and lead your store to become bigger and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no time to explain, let's start trading now and unlock the wealth password of unscrupulous merchants!</p>","developers":["Croc to the moon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756160/1ee7acde6ac1c7335f54fdb28713fdab0d50c2b1/header.jpg?t=1749648408","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150385,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150385/movie480.mp4?t=1748950882","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150385/movie_max.mp4?t=1748950882"},"name":"\u6e38\u620f\u4ecb\u7ecd","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150385/7c3be3fa467c9b2f8919092e544bda817feff31c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748950882","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150385/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748950882","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150385/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748950882"}}],"name":"\u8fd9\u5bb6\u5f53\u94fa\u6709\u5927\u95ee\u9898","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements